    "required": false,
    "schema": {
      "type": "integer"
    }
  }
]

```

## GET /api/volatility/option-sentiment/top

Screener of the most bullish/bearish tickers by options positioning (VWKS + AVAR) on a date.
Optional `direction` (`bullish`, `bearish`, `neutral`) and filters (`min_score`/`max_score`,
`min_vwks`/`max_vwks`, `min_avar`/`max_avar`, `min_sample_size`, `ticker_search`). Falls back to
the latest computed date on/before `date`.


```json
[
  {
    "description": "",
    "in": "query",
    "name": "date",
    "required": false,
    "schema": {
      "description": "A trading date in the format of YYYY-MM-DD.\nThis is optional and by default the last trading date.\n",
      "example": "2024-01-18",
      "title": "Optional Market Date",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  {
    "description": "Max rows (default 50, max 200).",
    "in": "query",
    "name": "limit",
    "required": false,
    "schema": {
      "type": "integer"
    }
  }
]

```

